  "text": "AGENTS.md is now at the repo root (renamed from agents.md — uppercase AGENTS.md is auto-discovered by agent runtimes). Key sections: bitwize-music skills, private-journal workflow, Google Drive MCP, GitHub CLI-first guide, general dispatch rules, mandatory journal close.\n\nGitHub section now has a CLI-vs-MCP table. `gh` CLI is not available in remote/web sessions — always check with `which gh` first. MCP is the fallback. Three operations are MCP-only: subscribe_pr_activity, resolve_review_thread, run_secret_scanning.\n\nPR #22 on netzkontrast/the-agency-system tracks this work. Branch: claude/list-skills-mcp-servers-XZqrr. Base: Master (capital M — passing base: main returns 422).",
